              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jakesmom"
            },
            "reviewBody": "There was too much filling for the crust. I used a 9\" crust and it was overflowing. Taste was great. Could use less sugar if your berries are sweet.",
            "datePublished": "2024-06-25T18:24:43.800Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Susan Watts"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this as written, and it came out just ok. The custard filling seemed extremely thick - it started thickening up immediately when I started cooking it, and had big globs in it that I had to break up with wooden spoon. This pie actually tasted better the next day, and whipped cream on top helped a lot.",
